are stored and translationally repressed in the oocyte and early embryo (By similarity). Also acts as a negative regulator of autophagy (PubMed:20537536). Involved in mediating interferon-gamma-induced cell death (PubMed:7828849)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_03","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}